                    <li>Constructed SQLite database links using <code>connect_args=&#123;"check_same_thread": False&#125;</code> parameters.</li>
                    <li>Utilized a secure context manager session handler (`with Session(engine) as session`) that safely commits transactional updates and isolates operations in concurrent processing environments.</li>
                    <li>Mapped database relations using SQLModel ORM structure, guaranteeing full schema safety while saving or editing OutreachDraft objects.</li>
                  </ul>
